      "line": 81,
      "note": "`:role` here is OpenLoam::Perspective#role — which membership role a SAVED VIEW (filters/sort/columns) is shared with, not the current user's own role. `authorize_manage!` already restricts update to the view's owner (always) or a manager (for shared views); the model docs and controller comments confirm an owner reassigning their own view's sharing audience is the intended behavior, not a privilege escalation. Brakeman flags the attribute name `:role` heuristically regardless of what it actually controls."
